{"id":68312,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68312"},"modified":"2026-10-26T10:16:08","modified_gmt":"2026-10-26T09:16:08","slug":"corrida-do-douro-navegavel","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-douro-navegavel\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00aa Corrida do Douro Naveg\u00e1vel 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00aa Corrida do Douro Naveg\u00e1vel 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1\u00aa Corrida do Douro Naveg\u00e1vel 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica cidade do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Peso da R\u00e9gua<\/strong> (distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila Real<\/strong>), no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da Regi\u00e3o Demarcada do Douro. Promovida pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">APDL \u2013 Administra\u00e7\u00e3o dos Portos do Douro, Leix\u00f5es e Viana do Castelo, S.A.<\/strong> e pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Centro de Cultura e Desporto da APDL<\/strong> (com dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da Eventsport e cronometragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real), a iniciativa integra as comemora\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais do Dia do Douro. Calcula o teu ritmo objetivo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explora o guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada junto ao <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Posto de Turismo da R\u00e9gua, na Avenida do Douro<\/strong>, o evento convida atletas e fam\u00edlias a correr com as encostas vinhateiras e o rio Douro como cen\u00e1rio. O programa come\u00e7a \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:45<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida Jovens Douro \/ Pequenos Navegantes de 500 metros<\/strong> (gratuita para crian\u00e7as dos 6 aos 10 anos, limitada a 100 vagas), seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong> o tiro de partida para a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (competitiva, para maiores de 18 anos) e para a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (l\u00fadica e aberta a todas as idades).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Todos os inscritos t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, dorsal, seguro desportivo, abastecimento de \u00e1gua e fruta e diploma digital. Na prova principal de 10 km, os tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina recebem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios de 300 \u20ac, 200 \u20ac e 150 \u20ac, havendo ainda trof\u00e9us para o p\u00f3dio de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores a Veteranos 65+), para as 3 melhores equipas e para a equipa mais numerosa.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pos